Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(191.2,161.067)\fnGeorgia}Maomao's Diaries
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I finally got a good night's sleep for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've recovered quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So dazzling!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, looking a bit haggard was \Nmuch easier on the eyes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have work to do, so—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maomao,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you want to hear an interesting story?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I happened to catch a rumor in town. \NIt's a completely bizarre and mysterious tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? \NMaybe another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of story is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there exists a miraculous garment that never burns, \Neven if you place it right over burning charcoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, is there really such a thing? 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the final miracle left behind by a lonely celestial maiden who was burned in a grand pyre... 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, a villager found a lost girl—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6F9B3F&\pos(219.6,32)}Time for Maomao's Trivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs8\c&H99A4AE&\pos(223.2,68.8)}Fire-Washed Cloth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a non-flammable cloth woven from asbestos (mineral fibers/asbestos stone).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because stains can be removed by washing it in fire, it earned that name. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It is also known as the "Robe of the Fire Rat".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In a foreign tale, it is said to be the treasure that a princess born from a bamboo stalk demanded as a condition for marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing. \NIs that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That reaction... \NYou already knew about it, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought your eyes would sparkle. \NWhat a romance-less wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do people really like romance that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.01,0:01:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\pos(189.6,244.8)}{\fs25\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H232323&\c&H000000&\2c&HFFFFFF&}Next time: \N"If They Have No Bread"
